  = 92KUTV

  73°

  New Utah judge takes on accused killer's death penalty case in

  Charlie Kirk murder

  by Jim Spiewak, KUTV | Wed, October 15th 2025 at 9:48 PM

  Updated Thu, October 16th 2025 at 5:56 AM

  VIEW ALL PHOTOS

  SALT LAKE CITY (KUTV) - Judge Tony Graf Jr. has found himself at the center of
  one

  of Utah's most closely watched murder cases less than two months after taking
  the

  bench.

  Utah State Bar

  @BasedSamParker

  @SamParkerSenate

  =

  Gov. Spencer Cox appoints

  Tony F. Graf to the Fourth

  District Court

  Press Releases

  Friday, May 2, 2025

  PRESS RELEASE

  SALT LAKE CITY (May 2, 2025) - Utah Gov. Spencer J. Cox has

  appointed Tony F. Graf to the Fourth District Court, filling a vacancy left

  by the retirement of Judge Robert Lunnen. Judicial appointments are

  subject to confirmation by the Utah Senate.
